---
import StudioLayout from '../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro';
---
<StudioLayout title="Guided relaxation" description="Choose a quiet guided session." privacyMode>
 <section class="sessions">
  <p class="eyebrow">AETHER / GUIDED RELAXATION</p>
  <h1>Take a moment for yourself</h1>
  <p class="intro">Choose a setting and follow gentle on-screen guidance. Sound is optional.</p>
  <div class="session-grid">
   <a class="session-card" href="/studio/underwater-sanctuary/">
    <img src="/images/experience-covers/underwater-sanctuary.png" alt="Wooden sanctuary overlooking an underwater window" width="664" height="441" />
    <div><span>UNTIMED · SILENT SESSION</span><h2>Underwater Sanctuary</h2><p>Rest your gaze on a quiet underwater scene as schooling fish, a shark silhouette or a ray gently swims into view.</p><strong>Open sanctuary →</strong></div>
   </a>
   <a class="session-card" href="/studio/temple-relaxation/">
    <img src="/images/experience-covers/temple.jpg" alt="Candlelit temple interior" width="1024" height="576" />
    <div><span>5–20 MINUTES · THREE PRACTICES</span><h2>A moment in the Temple</h2><p>Ground yourself, find clarity or reflect, with a warm scene and Om So Hum soundscape.</p><strong>Choose a practice →</strong></div>
   </a>
   <a class="session-card" href="/studio/evening-wind-down/">
    <img src="/images/experience-covers/night-garden.jpg" alt="Lantern-lit night garden" width="1024" height="576" />
    <div><span>FIVE MINUTES</span><h2>Evening wind-down</h2><p>Settle into the Night Garden with gentle wind and a simple guided five-minute session.</p><strong>Open session →</strong></div>
   </a>
   <a class="session-card" href="/studio/morning-in-the-forest/">
    <img src="/images/experience-covers/forest-dawn.webp" alt="Morning light over a mossy woodland grotto" width="1536" height="864" />
    <div><span>FIVE MINUTES · OPTIONAL SOUND</span><h2>Morning in the Forest</h2><p>Ease into your day with a peaceful woodland scene, drifting mist and five minutes of gentle guidance.</p><strong>Start your morning →</strong></div>
   </a>
  </div>
 </section>
</StudioLayout>
<style>
.sessions {max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 0;}
.eyebrow,.session-card span {color:#7dd3fc;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;}
h1 {font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,54px);margin:14px 0;line-height:1.1;}
.intro {color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:28px;}
.session-grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px;}
.session-card {overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:18px;background:#101827;color:#f8fafc;text-decoration:none;}
.session-card img {display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;}
.session-card div {padding:24px;}
.session-card h2 {margin:12px 0;font-size:24px;}
.session-card p {color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.7;}
.session-card strong {color:#6ee7b7;}
.session-card:hover {border-color:#7dd3fc;}
.session-card:focus-visible {outline:3px solid #7dd3fc;outline-offset:4px;}
@media(max-width:650px){.session-grid {grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
</style>
